# Kepler sensor receive: 433.425 MHz, 2-FSK 100 kbps, 20 kHz dev, 150 kHz filter; basic packets, sync 0xB19C0CA7, variable length, address byte, CRC-16 0x8005. Captured from the STEVAL-FKI433V2 kit on 2026-09-27 after setting it up to the sensor firmware's values; applied with reset=defaults
# register  value   (values are hexadecimal)
SYNT3                  0x72   # PLL_CP_ISEL=3 BS=1 SYNT_27_24=2
SYNT2                  0x2A   # SYNT=42
SYNT1                  0xC9   # SYNT=201
SYNT0                  0xF3   # SYNT=243
IF_OFFSET_ANA          0x2F   # IF_OFFSET_ANA=47
IF_OFFSET_DIG          0xC2   # IF_OFFSET_DIG=194
